So the header decoder is `D.[o?BIoI]`:
- D = descriptor
- . = anything (the descriptor value)
- [ = list
  - o = bool (durable)
  - ? = option
    - B = ubyte (priority)
  - I = uint (ttl)
  - o = bool (first_acquirer)
  - I = uint (delivery_count)
- ] = end list

